{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"],"type":"inheritsFrom","title":"Inherits From"},{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:23OUDSThemesOrangeCompact0bC5ThemeC","title":"OrangeCompactTheme","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange Compact"}],"symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Class"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/name"],"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Usages","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Usages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some products may have heavy and very rich user interfaces with a lot of components and elements to displays and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with which users can interact. Thus for such products there are specific constraints of spaces and sizes, even if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these products must be Orange flavored."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why this team is created: a kind of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" but wih adjustments on some tokens like spacings and sizings."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the theme:"}]},{"code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Integration","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" and get it through environment variable."}]},{"code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeCompactTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Theme tuning","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Theme-tuning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To apply the tuning:"}]},{"code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true,","                        hasRoundedTextInputs: true,","                        hasRoundedAlertMessages: false,","                        hasRoundedProgressIndicators: true,","                        hasRoundedListItems: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: tuning)","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Typography","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Typography"},{"text":"Helvetica Neue","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Helvetica-Neue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default an instance of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeCompactTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" uses as font family the token "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault"},{"type":"text","text":", which is today "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic"}]},{"type":"text","text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register them and define the font family name to use."}]},{"code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Tokens versions","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Tokens-versions"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core OUDS version: 1.11.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Brand Orange Compact version: 2.7.0","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.17.0"}]}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Orange Compact","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s8SendableP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"title":"OUDSTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTheme"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTheme"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"This is a basic theme any theme must be a subclass off, or all themes must have as ancestor.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A Swift ","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to implement all tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overridden.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"},{"text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"object oriented paradigm"}]},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"final"}]},{"text":" class, its type cannot be seen as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/SQ":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/SQ","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Equatable"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme/name":{"title":"name","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/name","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme\/name","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme name (“Orange Compact”)"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme":{"title":"OrangeCompactTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme","type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"text","text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI."}]},"ic_theme_orangecompact.png":{"identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png","alt":null,"type":"image","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/ic_theme_orangecompact.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s16SendableMetatypeP","type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact":{"title":"Theme Orange Compact","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange Compact theme is dedicated to applications with strong dimensions constraints."}]},"https://brand.orange.com/en/brand-basics/typography":{"identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","type":"link","title":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme/init(fontFamily:tuning:)":{"title":"init(fontFamily:tuning:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fontFamily"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic010FontFamilyB5Tokena","text":"FontFamilySemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract6Tuninga","text":"Tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme\/init(fontfamily:tuning:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Constructor of the OrangeCompact theme with its own providers of tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It uses also the providers of charts colors from Orange theme (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeThemeColorChartSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}}}